  "_doc": "Meanwhile, Inside (the human body), 'warm wonder': Eb major at 75 BPM, a resting heart rate (a beat is 0.8 s = 24 frames, a 16th exactly 6 frames at 30 fps). Dark, round pads; a wooden-mallet ostinato locked to the lub-dub (a note on every lub, and on every dub once the energy rises) over a quiet heartbeat pulse; soft mallets for labels and a mallet harmonic for binding, never glass bells (they are Lumevina's); close, wet foley in a small body-sized room. Signature: thump Eb2, thump Bb2 at +0.4 s, mallet G5 at +1.2 s (root, fifth, then the major third two octaves up). It plays on the title and end cards (signature) and at the end of every counter.",
